# Provider-credential scratch notes sometimes kept at the repo root while
# configuring a key (a SportsDataIO.txt was found open in an editor during the
# 2026-09-03 audit). They are never source; keep them out of any `git add .`.
/SportsDataIO*.txt
/*apikey*.txt
/*api-key*.txt
/*_key.txt

# OS/editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# Agent worktrees are full nested checkouts of this repository (each has its own
# .git). A broad `git add` would record them as embedded repositories; their
# work belongs on their own branches instead. See docs/REPOSITORY_AND_BACKUP.md.
.claude/worktrees/

# Research study cohort exports (immutable, but too large to track; the
# compressed copy and its SHA-256 manifest are committed alongside).
outputs/**/cohort.json

# SportsGameOdds raw payloads. Their terms forbid redistribution, republication
# and bulk export of Data; a captured response is licensed provider data and
# stays local. The derived validation record (structure, counts, findings) is
# committed instead.
outputs/sportsgameodds-validation/response.json
outputs/sportsgameodds-validation/validation.json
outputs/sportsgameodds-validation/pregame/
outputs/sportsgameodds-validation/slate/

# Bulk V18 evidence exports: regenerable from the database by
# server/scripts/v18_error_analysis_export.py, and tens of megabytes each.
outputs/v18-error-analysis-evidence/*.jsonl
